      <div>
        <head>Translated parts</head>
        <p pos="00001">
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2801.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.902Z">Thus have I heard:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2804.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.907Z">At one time,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2804.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.907Z">the Buddha was in Śrāvastī, at the Jètà Garden of the Benefactor of Orphans and the Solitary.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.907Z">The Buddha told Ānanda:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.907Z">"Now in my meditation,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">I grieve for worldly people who do not know the true, profound depth of the Buddha's path,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">yet with shallow, false, and frivolous words seek to harbor jealousy and slander the roots of the Way,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">wrongfully creating difficulties to trouble my disciples.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">You should maintain right mindfulness and know these sinful people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">who may be evil heretical teachers,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">or ignorant, deceitful worldly people.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">If any bodhisattvas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">bhikṣu saṅgha,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">bhikṣuṇīs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">upāsakas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">or upāsikās,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">who are well-versed in the scriptures and of high purity,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.908Z">enlighten the foolish and deluded,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">explaining to them the accumulation of sins and blessings in life and death,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">and if those listeners understand and accept the true Way,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">these are people whose sins are extinguished and blessings arise.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">If it is explained as clearly as showing them their palm,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">yet their minds are confused,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">unwilling to listen,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">though they may force themselves to hear,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">their minds are mostly asleep;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">or they damage the Dharma,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">disparage śramaṇas and upāsakas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">speak harshly and falsely,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">you should know clearly that such persons are dragged by their sins.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">Virtuous śramaṇas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">take patience as foremost,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.909Z">should be like clear water,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s31" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">which cleanses all without exception,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s32" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">whether corpses,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s33" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">dead dogs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s34" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">dead snakes,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s35" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">or excrement and urine, it washes them all,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s36" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">yet the water's clarity is not defiled.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s37" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">Similarly, maintain your mind</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s38" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">like a broom sweeping the ground,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s39" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">clean or unclean,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s40" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">corpses,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s41" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">dead dogs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s42" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">dead snakes,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s43" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">excrement and urine—all are swept away,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s44" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">yet the broom is not thereby defiled.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s45" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">Also be like the power of wind and fire,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s46" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.91Z">and light,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s47" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">which blow upon or burn</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s48" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">corpses,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s49" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">dead dogs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s50" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">dead snakes,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s51" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">excrement and urine,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s52" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">yet the power of wind and fire,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s53" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">and light, are not defiled.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s54" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">If someone seeks to kill you,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s55" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">do not feel anger;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s56" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">if someone seeks to slander you,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s57" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">do not feel anger;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s58" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">if someone seeks to defame you,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s59" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">do not feel anger;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s60" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">if someone seeks to mock you,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s61" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.911Z">do not feel anger;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s62" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">if someone seeks to ruin you,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s63" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">to make you abandon the Buddha's Dharma,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s64" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">do not feel anger;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s65" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">only maintain a compassionate mind and right intention,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s66" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">so that sins are extinguished and blessings arise,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s67" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">the evil cannot enter the righteous,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0534c2817.s68" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">and all evils dissolve and rot away.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">The Buddha told Ānanda:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">"Those with good hearts and virtuous intentions,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">who hear the Buddha's clear teachings,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">and listen with single-minded focus,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">even if for just one day, it is acceptable;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">if not one day,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">half a day is acceptable;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.912Z">if not half a day,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">one hour is acceptable;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">if not one hour,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">half an hour is acceptable;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">if not half an hour,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">even a moment is acceptable;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">their blessings are immeasurable,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a1814.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">and beyond calculation.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">"You should widely expound this to the bhikṣu saṅgha,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">bhikṣuṇīs,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">upāsakas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s4" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">upāsikās,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s5" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">and laypeople,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s6" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">and also extensively explain the practice of dāna,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s7" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">planting the provisions for life and death.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s8" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">On observance days,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s9" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">prepare food offerings,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s10" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">invite the four assemblies of high-minded scripture masters and virtuous ones,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s11" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">śramaṇas,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s12" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">and practitioners,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s13" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.913Z">set up high seats,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s14" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">discuss and expound the Buddhist scriptures,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s15" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">burn incense and light lamps,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s16" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">their radiance reaching the heavens.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s17" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">The devas smile with joy,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s18" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">descend through the void,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s19" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">and listen intently,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s20" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">all with gladness.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s21" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">Those who overcome stinginess,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s22" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">and perform dāna for merit,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s23" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">good spirits will descend immediately,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s24" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">protecting their households,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s25" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">warding off disasters and eliminating anomalies,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s26" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">bringing forth beneficial encounters,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s27" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">benefits that bring auspiciousness,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s28" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">ending without resentment or evil.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s29" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">Just as planting grains</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s30" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">yields according to the seed sown,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s31" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">planting goodness reaps blessings,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s32" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">planting evil brings calamity,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s33" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.914Z">none gain fruits without sowing.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s34" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">Maintain right mindfulness,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s35" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">and blessings will naturally return to you;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s36" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">be careful not to resort to divination,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s37" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">lest you be led astray by evil;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s38" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">harboring doubts in mind,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s39" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">good spirits distance themselves from people,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s40" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">actions fall into sinful grounds,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s41" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">and endeavors fail.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s42" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">Unaware of their own precept-breaking,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s43" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">they instead blame the Buddha and spirits,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s44" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">serving them brings no benefit,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s45" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">thus they fail to correct their minds.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s46" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">Men</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s47" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">and women who hear this sūtra,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s48" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">and uphold, recite, and chant it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535a2209.s49" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">none fail to obtain blessings.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535b0602.s1" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">When the Buddha finished speaking the sūtra,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535b0602.s2" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">Ānanda rejoiced,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#T17n0733_CBETA_001-0535b0602.s3" xml:lang="en" resp="#deepseek-deepseek-chat" generatedBy="bot-deepseek-chat" modified="2025-11-28T03:56:07.915Z">rose, and bowed to the Buddha.</seg>
  </p>
